Rule 3 (Source and destination dtypes must match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_3)
>>
Rule 9 (Shape of value tensor should be broadcastable to the indexing result shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |=  ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_3) - 1] : shape(v_3, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_3, i) = shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 11 (The number of indices cannot exceed the number of dimensions of the input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(tensor)} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ v_2.len
>>
Rule 12 (The number of indices cannot exceed the number of dimensions of the input tensor (list version))
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(tensor)} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ v_2.len
>>
Rule 28 (If input tensor is 1D then indices must be 1D)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tuple(tensor)} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 then v_2.len = 1
